# 📘 TOEFL Academic Vocabulary - Day18

| Word | Meaning | Example |
|---|---|---|
| contribute | 기여하다 | Exercise contributes to good health. |
| distribute | 분배하다, 배포하다 | The organization distributes food to local communities. |
| sufficient | 충분한 | The researchers collected sufficient data. |

---

## Synonyms

contribute
→ help / add to

distribute
→ provide / spread

sufficient
→ enough / adequate

---

## Today's Mission

- [ ] Memorize all three words.
- [ ] Write a sentence using **contribute**.
- [ ] Write a sentence using **sufficient**.

